src/leeth/data/leeth_dataset.jsonl

# Leeth 3 teacher data (generated; the specs, AGENT.md and FORMAT.md stay in git)
leeth3_data/incoming/
leeth3_data/accepted/
leeth3_data/rejected/
leeth3_data/reports/
leeth3_data/queue/

# Heavy generated data: the specs, AGENT.md and FORMAT.md stay in git, the corpora do not
